WEBVTT

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:02.380
<v><b>A:</b></v> Are you having a holiday this summer?

00:00:02.620 --> 00:00:06.255
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, we’ve got some time off in July, so we’re going to the Lake District.

00:00:06.341 --> 00:00:07.747
<v><b>A:</b></v> Don’t you usually go abroad?

00:00:07.988 --> 00:00:11.816
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, but we’ve decided to stay in the UK and rent a cottage.

00:00:11.995 --> 00:00:15.293
We’re trying to cut down on air travel, you know, to save the planet.

00:00:15.427 --> 00:00:17.274
We’re big fans of Greta Thunberg…